# Debian trixie ships xfconf 4.20.0; xfwl4's libxfce4kbd-private-sys and
# xfconf-sys crates pin >= 4.21.2/4.21.4 respectively, so the stock package
# cannot satisfy the compositor build. Mirrors ../../xfconf.spec.
